  "steps": [
   "The scheduler starts the batch (job chain F12 -> F11 -> F08).",
   "Delete all rows of TB_R_H0253_ORDER_CONTROL_PRE (NSP) and insert the rows of TB_R_H0253_ORDER_CONTROL_PRE (DB Surrounding) with ORDER_STATUS = '7' (same columns and values). HOLD_FLAG and PO_MAPPED_FLAG are NSP-only columns (set in ASN Cross Dock Creation F10): before the delete their values are kept per unique key and put back on the inserted rows; a new key gets 'N'.",
   "No error: commit. Error: roll back step 2 (one transaction). Record the result in the Log. Exit."
